        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gates of Hell have burst open.</strong><br>Relentless hordes flood the world - from rabid hellhounds to towering archdemons. With every minute, chaos creeps closer… You must survive, adapt, and carve your own path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique classes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior, Mage, Lord, Artisan, Leader, Necromancer, Peasant, and Druid. From brutal combat to dark necromancy - each class unlocks a distinct path to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk the fog of war for epic loot or play it safe clearing secure regions?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, seize, or forge the gear you need?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your foes, bribe them, or slip by unseen?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your allies or focus all power on yourself?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; combat:</strong> journey through a procedurally generated world, uncover ruins and dungeons, and battle the forces of Hell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy &amp; construction:</strong> gather rare materials, build, upgrade structures, and trade to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad &amp; progress:</strong> recruit allies, empower your party, and develop unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment &amp; magic:</strong> forge legendary weapons, enhance them, and unleash devastating spells to turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paths to victory:</strong> Conquer through strength, magic, economy, or cunning craftsmanship - the choice is yours. Will you be the one to seal the Gates of Hell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>Sandbox mode</strong> at your own pace, or test your limits in <strong>Nightmare mode</strong>, where even starting as a humble peasant can become a fatal mistake.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gates of Hell have burst open.</strong><br>Relentless hordes flood the world - from rabid hellhounds to towering archdemons. With every minute, chaos creeps closer… You must survive, adapt, and carve your own path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 unique classes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior, Mage, Lord, Artisan, Leader, Necromancer, Peasant, and Druid. From brutal combat to dark necromancy - each class unlocks a distinct path to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice matters:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you risk the fog of war for epic loot or play it safe clearing secure regions?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, seize, or forge the gear you need?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your foes, bribe them, or slip by unseen?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your allies or focus all power on yourself?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core mechanics:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; combat:</strong> journey through a procedurally generated world, uncover ruins and dungeons, and battle the forces of Hell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy &amp; construction:</strong> gather rare materials, build, upgrade structures, and trade to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad &amp; progress:</strong> recruit allies, empower your party, and develop unique skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment &amp; magic:</strong> forge legendary weapons, enhance them, and unleash devastating spells to turn the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paths to victory:</strong> Conquer through strength, magic, economy, or cunning craftsmanship - the choice is yours. Will you be the one to seal the Gates of Hell?</p><p class=